# XOR/AND/OR gateways, labels, automatic joins, a loop and an empty branch.
# covers: §4.3, §6.2, §7, §7.1
title "Article publishing"

start Draft ready
task Write article @write
user Review article
xor Approved?
  yes:
  needs changes:
    task Apply feedback
    -> @write                    # loop back; this branch is closed
  rejected: end Article dropped
# Only the empty "yes" branch is open ("needs changes" jumps back,
# "rejected" ends), so no join is needed: the gateway flows straight on.
and
  - task Create images
  - task Write social posts
  - task Translate article
# AND-join inserted here automatically
or Extra channels?
  newsletter: service Add to newsletter
  podcast:    task Record audio version
  else:
task Publish
end Published
